### First-study synthesis key
Order L5: entities, lines, local-facts, connections, standards, chronology, progressions, duties, bias, observation-log, query-language, retrieval, calculations. L1: civil-time after jurisdictions, calc-grammar. L6: answers after skills.
chronology (L5, stage 2, K1439): holds a document's own dated facts with method and grade; ownDate, datesOf, chronology({scope}); first writer reading pipeline at read time + re-read job. progressions R16 anchors on event's own date (K1444(ii)). civil-time: EDTF L1 3-way compare, RRULE subset, fiscal periods, validAt; now from caller. duties DUT- (K1440): modality, obligor (never private individual), obligee, performance, source (standard|court para|practice|dependency), trigger (event|recurrence|date|request), time rule, exceptions, enforcer, observed_by (progression stage/watch/doc kind), arising_in, reported_status, in_force; occurrences derived {due, state met|met_late|overdue|pending|discharged|undetermined, evidence, why} OCDS milestone; deliverable date from chronology. Queue kind temporal-expectation-due produced. K1431 dependency due dates {precedes: event, lead, why}. lines LIN- (K1439/K1441/K1442) kinds: part_of post_in holds reports_to oversees appoints seat_on funds contracts_with acts_for responsible_for custodian_of successor_of party_to appeal_of consolidated_with remanded_to arises_from; two-axis grade; walk depth 6 fan-out 1000. Entities kinds add program, place, proceeding (K1441). Proceeding is entity kind; register reading not a store; row diff. standards law relations amends repeals renumbers recodifies (temporal) and refers_to defines excepts implements interprets applies holds_invalid (referential); MatterEnactmentDate as enactment event source. As-of model §3.4: {valid:{from,to,precision},basis} via civil-time.validAt -> in|out|undetermined; bitemporal valid vs record time. B7 (K1443) machine writes reader-stated dates with method. B9 (K1444) (i) direction-aware uncertainty: group's deadlines earliest; body overdue only after latest candidate; "possibly overdue" between; (iii) local day. B13 (K1447) occurrence of sourced duty as leg (stage 2); calculation leg; standard leg. B10 (K1445) profiles hold sourced rules incl recurrences. Stage 3 work: lateness pattern and timeline view; validAt; EXTRACT dated facts. B20 timelines in contradiction inquiries and projects; Legistar minutes lag 2026: 130 events, 24 cancelled, minutes for 105, median 15 days, 33 over 21 days; 29 of 106 agendas last published <72h before (upper bound, not a violation). Adopted: OCD Event shape, Legistar Events, EDTF L1, RFC5545, Akoma Ntoso event-bounded intervals, OCDS Period. Taggers 70-78%. K1432 everyday speed: measured response budget test; heavy work background.
Still Bob's: B12, B16(i)-(ii), B17(ii), B18, B21, B22. K1461 cause = DEC-84 (10).
