### First-study studies key
TIME: model items: civil date {value EDTF-L1, zone, source, method}; dated fact {capture, extent, kind meeting|adopted|effective|signed|published|hearing|period_covered|edited, value, method, grade}; recurrence {body, kind, rrule, zone, valid, source}; observed meeting OCD-shaped; chronology a read, never stored {scope inquiry|project|entity|action, items, ties/bands undetermined}; adopt OCD Event, Legistar Events API (webapi.legistar.com/Help), EDTF, Akoma Ntoso eventRef. Gaps G3 anchoring, G4 meetings, G8 chronology. Interfaces table. Readers parse only "Month D, YYYY" (agenda :84-91) and M/D/YYYY (calendar :41-45) at UTC midnight.
COURTS: proceeding entity kind; register a reading; row diff; stages progression per kind; ECF docket entry; CourtListener docket->entries->documents; court-watch NOLA 130 volunteers. Gaps A4 court-set dates.
ORGS: W3C ORG ChangeEvent (original->resulting orgs) -> successor_of line; FtM Occupancy; OCDS Milestone {dueDate,dateMet,status}; Legistar OfficeRecords; NYC tracker. Holders follow sources pattern.
